<div class="mandarin-hanzi">忙</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">máng</div>

''Meaning:'' busy  
''Part of speech:'' adjective; stative verb

!! In context
老师现在很忙。 — Lǎoshī xiànzài hěn máng. — The teacher is busy now.

!! Usage note
A stative predicate. 很 (hěn) in 他很忙 (Tā hěn máng) need not imply 'very'; it often makes an unmarked adjectival predicate natural.
